    "regime_notes": "40d IC: early +0.005531 (124 dates), middle +0.020589 (181), late +0.049492 (810). 60d IC: middle +0.037210 (109), late +0.060830 (790); no early aligned observations. Strongest at 40-60d and materially overlaps the contemporaneous trend-break volatility-scaled reversal artifact, so downstream ensemble correlation control is important.",
